title square screen, a notice replaces the counter row (a tap dismisses it)
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_NOTICE "Saved 3 new files"
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "Saved 3 new files"
shot notice
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect text "SOFT"
tap "Saved 3 new files"
wait 300
expect notext "Saved 3 new files"
expect text "CARD"
expect noquit
